WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700 line:10%
Are you sure you make your own decisions?

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.000 line:10%
That you choose

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000 line:10%
whom to love, what to think about?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:10%
What if I told you

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.700 line:10%
that you are mistaken — that the choice is not really yours?

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.000 line:10%
That something within you has already set the rules

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000 line:10%
by which you will make those decisions?

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.600 line:10%
On November 14 at 17:00,

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.000 line:10%
I invite you to the Kreativnoye Byuro loft,
at 33 Bilibina Street.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.800 line:10%
We will talk about all four Matrix films.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.000 line:10%
About love,

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.000 line:10%
freedom and choice.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000 line:10%
About how we can escape the very system

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.000 line:10%
we are part of,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000 line:10%
which we create ourselves

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000 line:10%
through our actions and thoughts.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.315 line:10%
Become a little freer. Come along.
